{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dino Party, a multiplayer brawler where classic party-game chaos meets fast, punchy combat. Grab your friends\u2014online or on the couch\u2014and dive into a wild party full of silly physics, unpredictable minigames, and over-the-top dinosaur action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 players (local &amp; online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ different maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Multiplayer Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino customization</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seamless Minigame Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience nonstop action as the stadium morphs seamlessly between explosive minigames. Whether you\u2019re teaming up for 2v2 soccer brawls, dodging crumbling lava floors, or surviving a frantic game of hot potato, every match brings fresh hazards and surprises. No two rounds are ever alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/057ced7c81277b29a50df39d3d2d630b.poster.avif?t=1771513461\" width=780 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/057ced7c81277b29a50df39d3d2d630b.webm?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/057ced7c81277b29a50df39d3d2d630b.mp4?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Punch First, Ask Questions Later</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two buttons. Endless chaos. Chain punches to send rivals flying, shield just in time to stay alive, or crush everything below you with a mighty ground-pound that leaves no survivors. Whether you\u2019re a tactical player or a wild brawler, everyone gets their moment to shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/471c61ce52efb4dfad4a716e03c29d09.poster.avif?t=1771513461\" width=780 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/471c61ce52efb4dfad4a716e03c29d09.webm?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/471c61ce52efb4dfad4a716e03c29d09.mp4?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautiful Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the action kicks in, things tend to break\u2014walls, towers, friendships. Destruction adds that extra burst of spectacle to the party, making every brawl feel bigger, louder, and messier in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/6de81dbdff78cc627f5c64200b15ae7d.poster.avif?t=1771513461\" width=780 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/6de81dbdff78cc627f5c64200b15ae7d.webm?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/6de81dbdff78cc627f5c64200b15ae7d.mp4?t=1771513461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Dino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says dinosaurs can\u2019t be stylish? Mix colors, patterns, materials, and accessories (robot tail? lava horns?) to create a creature that\u2019s uniquely yours\u2014then show off your style as you dominate the next minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/29d0d50de629d7c4f14503799d6456ab.avif?t=1771513461\" width=780 height=288 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1939390?t=1771513461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771513461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/53dd7e2e29c41a3990f7af964d44a25980c559a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771513461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/53dd7e2e29c41a3990f7af964d44a25980c559a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771513461","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3778690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dino Party, a multiplayer brawler where classic party-game chaos meets fast, punchy combat. Grab your friends\u2014online or on the couch\u2014and dive into a wild party full of silly physics, 